.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-migrate 1  "xil-migrate " 
.SH NAME
xil\-migrate \- Migrate episode stems from an old parsed JSON to a revised one. Copies unchanged stems to their new seq\-numbered filenames; reports what still needs TTS/SFX generation. Run XILP002 afterwards to fill the gaps.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-migrate\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-old\fR] [\fB\-\-new\fR] [\fB\-\-stems\fR] [\fB\-\-orig\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrate episode stems from an old parsed JSON to a revised one. Copies unchanged stems to their new seq\-numbered filenames; reports what still needs TTS/SFX generation. Run XILP002 afterwards to fill the gaps.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S02E03); derives \-\-old, \-\-new, and \-\-stems paths automatically
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01); same as \-\-episode but skips format validation
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-old\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Old parsed JSON (overrides \-\-episode)
.TP
\fB\-\-new\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
New parsed JSON (overrides \-\-episode)
.TP
\fB\-\-stems\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Stems directory (overrides \-\-episode)
.TP
\fB\-\-orig\-prefix\fR \fI<ORIG_PREFIX>\fR [default: orig_]
Filename prefix for the old parsed JSON (default: orig_)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show plan without copying any files
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Exact text match only. Default is fuzzy: ignores em\-dash/ellipsis variants so punctuation\-only edits don\*(Aqt force unnecessary regen
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only the summary, not per\-stem details
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
